Server-side import of v2.0 deck export JSON into internal pool user accounts.

- `extractCardsFromExportJson.ts` — flatten export `cards` object (ported from `public/js/components/deck-import.js`)
- `resolveExportCardIds.ts` — name→id resolution via `buildAvailableCardsMap`
- `importDeckFromExport.ts` — orchestrates create + `replaceAllCardsInDeck` (default user: `community_decks`)
- `importCommunityDeckFromExport.ts` — thin re-export alias for community callers
- CLIs: `scripts/import-community-deck.ts` (`npm run import:community-deck`), `scripts/import-tournament-deck.ts` (`npm run import:tournament-deck`)
- Seed: `scripts/seed-tournament-decks.ts` (`npm run seed:tournament-decks`) for initial Nationals fixtures

Pool users: `COMMUNITY_DECKS_USER_ID` (`...000002`), `TOURNAMENT_DECKS_USER_ID` (`...000003`).
